   "title_cn": "尼日利亚主教呼吁奥孙州政界人士勿让政治分歧演变为仇恨",
   "title_original": "Don’t allow political differences turn hatred, Bishop tells Osun politicians",
   "summary_cn": "尼日利亚奥孙州伊杰萨北圣公会教区主教伊萨克·奥卢亚莫呼吁该州政界人士不要让政治分歧成为仇恨或分裂的永久来源。主教在一份声明中作出上述表态，并呼吁民众放下上次州长选举造成的分歧，寻求和解。该消息目前为单一来源报道。",
   "summary_original": "The Bishop of Ijesa North Anglican Diocese, Isaac Oluyamo, has urged politicians in Osun State not to allow political differences to become sources of hatr Read More: https://punchng.com/dont-allow-political-differences-turn-hatred-bishop-tells-osun-politicians/",
   "event_time": "2026-09-19T01:08:09Z",
