   "title_original": "Woman, 4 children burnt to death in Rivers residence",
   "summary_cn": "尼日利亚河流州Okrika地方政府区Okochiri社区一处住所发生火灾，一名母亲及其四名子女在睡梦中被烧死。火灾原因尚未查明。该事件目前为单一来源报道。",
   "summary_original": "A mother and her four children were burnt to death in the early hours of Friday when fire engulfed their residence at Okochiri community in Okrika Local Government Area (LGA) of Rivers State. Daily Trust gathered that the incident occurred while the family was asleep, although the actual cause of the fire has yet to […]",
