   "title_cn": "尼日利亚军方在卡杜纳和卡齐纳解救被绑架人员",
   "title_original": "Troops Rescue Kidnap Victims, Recover Vehicle in Kaduna, Katsina",
   "summary_cn": "尼日利亚西北联合特遣部队“Fansan Yamma”行动部队在卡杜纳州和卡齐纳州分别开展行动，解救六名被绑架人员。军方称行动依据情报线索并回应求救呼叫，于9月17日实施。相关行动还包括在卡杜纳-比尔宁瓜里公路查获一名涉嫌贩毒人员，以及在索科托州击退恐怖分子袭击并解救两名被绑架人员。",
   "summary_original": "Troops of the Joint Task Force North-West, Operation Fansan Yamma, have rescued six kidnapped victims during separate operations in Kaduna and Katsina states. The victims were rescued on Thursday, September 17, following intelligence-led operations and responses to distress calls in the two states. In Kaduna State, troops of Sector 1 of the operation, acting on […]",
   "event_time": "2026-09-18T21:22:55Z",
   "published_time": "2026-09-18T21:22:55Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
