   "body_extracted": "The Plateau State Police Command has arrested 32 suspects for various offences, including kidnapping and human trafficking, and recovered 10 rifles and 54 rounds of live ammunition in operations across the state.\nThe State Commissioner of Police, Ayodeji Faniyan, disclosed this on Friday while briefing journalists at the Command Headquarters in Jos on the operational breakthroughs recorded by the command.\nFaniyan said that since assuming duty about two months ago, his administration had prioritised intelligence-led policing, proactive crime prevention, professional conduct and zero tolerance for corruption among personnel.\nHe said the achievements recorded were a result of the collective efforts of officers and men of the command, as well as timely information provided by members of the public.",
