   "title_cn": "索马里惩教部队前指挥官称其住所遭F-16战机空袭",
   "title_original": "Custodial Corps Commander provides details on how the Doolow attack unfolded.",
   "summary_cn": "索马里惩教部队前指挥官马哈德·阿卜迪拉赫曼·阿丹（绰号“舒布指挥官”）就其位于盖多州多洛区的住所遭袭事件提供新说法，声称袭击由一架F-16战机实施。他否认哈桑·谢赫·马哈茂德政府关于爆炸系屋内制造爆炸装置所致的说法，并指控其前司机引导了此次空袭。关于袭击责任方，各方说法不一，哈桑·谢赫政府否认参与，而西南部当局等方坚称该住所被直接击中。",
   "summary_original": "The former Commander of the Somali Correctional Corps, Brigadier General Mahad Abdirahman Adan—known as Commander Shub—has provided new details regarding the recent attack on his home in the Dolow district of the Gedo region. Commander Shub stated that the attack on his residence was carried out by an F-16 fighter jet; he vehemently rejected claims […]",
