   "title_original": "Embrace AI, advanced surveillance to fight insecurity, CDS tells military",
   "summary_cn": "尼日利亚国防参谋长Olufemi Oluyede将军在卡杜纳为尼日利亚国防学院指挥中心及其他三个项目揭幕时，要求尼日利亚武装部队运用人工智能和先进监控系统等新兴技术，以提升态势感知和应对不断演变的安全威胁的能力。他表示当代安全挑战性质的变化要求军方持续适应并部署技术以增强作战效能。该消息目前为单一来源报道。",
   "summary_original": "The Chief of Defence Staff, Gen. Olufemi Oluyede, has charged the Nigerian Armed Forces to use AI and advanced surveillance to fight evolving security thre Read More: https://punchng.com/embrace-ai-advanced-surveillance-to-fight-insecurity-cds-tells-military/",
