   "title_original": "Army seeks partnership for local production of UAV drones",
   "summary_cn": "尼日利亚陆军参谋长Waidi Shuabu中将呼吁与石油技术发展基金（PTDF）建立合作，以促进技能发展和无人机的本土生产。该请求是在周五于阿布贾拜访PTDF执行秘书Shuaibu Shehu Aliyu教授时提出的。目前仅有一个来源报道此事。",
   "summary_original": "Chief of Army Staff, Lt General Waidi Shuabu, has called for a partnership with the Petroleum Technology Development Fund (PTDF) to enable skills development and local production of Unmanned Aerial Vehicles. The COAS made the request during a courtesy visit to the Executive Secretary of PTDF, Prof. Shuaibu Shehu Aliyu, on Friday in Abuja. Lt […]",
