   "title_cn": "尼日尔州因矿工死亡事件实施宵禁",
   "title_original": "Miners’ Death: Niger Govt Imposes Dusk-to-Dawn Curfew",
   "summary_cn": "尼日尔州州长穆罕默德·乌马鲁·巴戈在明纳实施12小时宵禁，以防止法律与秩序进一步遭到破坏。州长是在内政部长奥卢布米·通吉-奥乔就37名手工采矿者在尼日利亚安全和民防部队羁押期间死亡一事进行吊唁访问时宣布这一措施的。",
   "summary_original": "Niger State Governor Mohammed Umaru Bago has imposed a 12-hour curfew in Minna to forestall further breach of law and order. The governor announced this when he received Minister of Interior, Olubunmi Tunji-Ojo, on a condolence visit over the death of 37 artisanal miners in the custody of the Nigeria Security and Civil Defence Corps […]",
   "event_time": "2026-09-18T22:16:01Z",
