   "title_cn": "卡杜纳州立大学ASUU暂停罢工",
   "title_original": "Kaduna Varsity ASUU Suspends Strike",
   "summary_cn": "尼日利亚卡杜纳州立大学（KASU）的大学学术人员工会（ASUU）在卡杜纳州政府批准落实2025年联邦政府与ASUU协议后，于2026年9月17日（周四）的代表大会上一致同意暂停正在进行的罢工。州政府表示将把给予KASU学术人员的薪资相关让步扩展至其他州立高等院校，并已成立九人高等教育机构谈判委员会。相关消息目前为单一来源报道。",
   "summary_original": "The Academic Staff Union of Universities (ASUU), Kaduna State University (KASU) chapter, has suspended its ongoing strike following the Kaduna State Government’s approval of the implementation and domestication of the 2025 Federal Government-ASUU agreement for academic staff. The union announced the suspension after its congress meeting on Thursday, September 17, 2026, where members unanimously accepted […]",
   "event_time": "2026-09-18T21:20:01Z",
   "published_time": "2026-09-18T21:20:01Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
   "verification_level": "single_source",
   "verification_label_cn": "单一来源",
   "independent_source_count": 1,
   "source_links": [
    {
     "url": "https://dailytrust.com/kaduna-varsity-asuu-suspends-strike/",
