   "summary_cn": "莫桑比克南部赞巴拉地区18日晚发生一起交通事故，造成至少24人死亡、2人受伤，其中1人伤势严重。伊尼扬巴内省政府表示，事故发生在1号国道上，涉及一辆客运车辆与一辆对向行驶的卡车。据初步报道，死者均为客运车辆乘客，事故具体原因尚未确定，警方尚未正式置评。",
   "summary_original": "At least 24 people were killed and two others injured, one of them seriously, in a road accident on Thursday night in Zavala district, southern Mozambique, the Inhambane Provincial Government said on Friday. The accident occurred on National Highway Number 1 (N1). In a statement, shared moments ago on his official Facebook page, Inhambane Governor… Source",
