   "title_cn": "尼日利亚纳萨拉瓦州消防部门称1至9月响应超80起紧急呼叫",
   "title_original": "Fire Service responds to over 80 emergency calls in Nasarawa — Controller",
   "summary_cn": "尼日利亚纳萨拉瓦州联邦消防局表示，2026年1月至9月期间共响应超过80起紧急呼叫，涵盖火灾及其他救援行动，挽救生命并保全价值数百万奈拉的财产。该州消防局长Eno Nwachukwu在拉菲亚举行的“余烬月”消防安全宣传活动中披露上述数据。此信息目前为单一来源。",
   "summary_original": "The Federal Fire Service in Nasarawa State says it responded to over 80 emergency calls and saved property worth millions between January and September. Read More: https://punchng.com/fire-service-responds-to-over-80-emergency-calls-in-nasarawa-controller/",
   "event_time": "2026-09-19T00:46:15Z",
   "published_time": "2026-09-19T00:46:15Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
   "verification_level": "single_source",
   "verification_label_cn": "单一来源",
   "independent_source_count": 1,
   "source_links": [
    {
     "url": "https://punchng.com/fire-service-responds-to-over-80-emergency-calls-in-nasarawa-controller/?utm_source=rss.punchng.com&utm_medium=web",
     "source_name": "Punch",
     "source_group": "ng",
     "language": "en"
    }
   ],
   "potential_impact": "",
   "progress": "",
   "current_policy_passed": true,
   "quality_gate_passed": true,
   "legacy_migration_preserved": false,
   "legacy_visibility": true,
   "publication_reason": "Stage 3B 真实采集",
   "body_extracted": "The Nasarawa State Command of the Federal Fire Service has said it responded to over 80 emergency calls, ranging from fire incidents to other rescue operations across Nasarawa State, between January and September 2026, saving lives and property.\nThe Controller, Federal Fire Service in the state, Eno Nwachukwu, disclosed this during the fire service sensitisation and enlightenment campaign for the Ember months, which took place on Friday in Lafia, the state capital.\nOur correspondent reports that the Ember months fire safety campaign was themed, “Fire Safety, Emergency Evacuation And Practical First Aid Fire Fighting Drill.”\nNwachukwu explained that the command had recorded overwhelming success in responding to fire calls, saving several lives and salvaging property worth millions of naira.",
