   "title_cn": "尼日利亚尼日尔州长称67名矿工被关押后37人死亡",
   "title_original": "67 miners crowded into NSCDC cell before 37 died – Niger gov",
   "summary_cn": "尼日尔州州长穆罕默德·巴戈表示，67名手工采矿及涉嫌非法采矿人员被关押在尼日利亚安全与民防部队（NSCDC）拘留室后，其中37人死亡。这些矿工于2026年9月15日和16日在尼日尔州M.I. Wushishi和Lukoto地区被捕。NSCDC最初将死亡归因于疑似疾病暴发，但随后表示实际死因尚未确定，有待医学和实验室检查。",
   "summary_original": "Niger State Governor Mohammed Bago says 37 of 67 arrested miners died in an overcrowded NSCDC cell, with investigations into the cause ongoing. Read More: https://punchng.com/67-miners-crowded-into-nscdc-cell-before-37-died-niger-gov/",
   "event_time": "2026-09-18T23:53:47Z",
   "published_time": "2026-09-18T23:53:47Z",
   "location": "",
   "china_related": false,
