   "summary_cn": "尼日利亚拉各斯岛布罗德街一栋六层建筑发生火灾，死亡人数已升至10人。多名幸存者向《每日信报》表示，应急响应迟缓且不足，首批救援人员为当地青年。安全专业人士呼吁加强高层建筑消防管理与人员培训。",
   "summary_original": "Some of the suspected illegal miners who shared same detention facility with the 37 suspects who died in custody have recounted their experience. Daily Trust reports that at least 37 suspected illegal miners who were arrested by operatives of the Nigeria Security and Civil Defence Corps (NSCDC) lost their lives barely two days after they […]",
